<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 3-mth T-bills with 12 pct coupon.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 3-mth T-bills with 12 pct coupon.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer a three-month T-bill issue with a fixed coupon of 12 percent until maturity at an auction on Friday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The issue will be offered with no par value or minimum acceptable price set in advance.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	  BG3031097010</p>
<p> Term		    three months</p>
<p> Auction date	  April 25</p>
<p> Issue date	    May 2</p>
<p> Maturity date	 August 1</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
